  "name": "guardian-inspiring-leader-ballads-survive-ranks-6836",
  "contract": [
    "Inspiring Leader 505344 (Inspiration specialization 20) transforms the Guardian's Pulverize and Broad Sweep",
    "into the Ballads. Broad Sweep ranks 805150, 504177-504182 and Pulverize ranks 800311, 802439-802443 are",
    "trained rank by rank, and the level-appropriate Ballad of the Dragonslayer (801772, 501066, 501067, ...) or",
    "Ballad of the Conqueror (801776, 501068, 501069, ...) has to stand in for every rank the character holds.",
    "#6836: buying a higher rank of Broad Sweep or Pulverize must keep that Ballad on the ability, instead of",
    "reverting it to the plain rank. The core deactivates the plain rank below when a higher one is learned and",
    "cues the client with SMSG_SUPERCEDED_SPELL(lower rank, higher rank); the client swaps every action button",
    "that held the lower rank onto the higher one. The handler then points the higher rank at the Ballad, and",
    "drops the now-dead entry of the deactivated lower rank. Dropping it while announcing",
    "SMSG_SUPERCEDED_SPELL(Ballad, deactivated plain rank) is what the client acts on: it swaps the button that",
    "shows the Ballad back onto the plain rank, which is the reported reversal. So no cue may ever name a plain",
    "Broad Sweep or Pulverize rank as the spell another spell is superseded by, while exactly one cue per",
    "purchase must point the new plain rank at the level-appropriate Ballad. At level 25 those are 504178 ->",
    "501067 (Broad Sweep rank 3 -> Ballad of the Dragonslayer rank 3) and 802441 -> 501069 (Pulverize rank 4 ->",
    "Ballad of the Conqueror rank 3)."
  ],
